{"id":"b52d0cec39806ded","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-model10-los-map.md","title":"ZFC Model10 Los Map","display":"df-zfc-model10-los-map — ZFC Model10 Los Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model10-los-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model10-los-map"],"display":"df-zfc-model10-los-map — ZFC Model10 Los Map","depends_on":["[[./58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model10-los-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model10-los-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model10-los-map — ZFC Model10 Los Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"./58-df-ultrafilter.md\">58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,U,I,\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\mathcal D_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal M,I}\\in V\">\\(L,U,I,\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\mathcal D_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal M,I}\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span> are as in the cited dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_{\\bar f,i}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,\\bar f(x)(i)\\rangle:x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\}\">\\(s_{\\bar f,i}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,\\bar f(x)(i)\\rangle:x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\}\\)</span> is the assignment induced at coordinate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10LosMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel10LosMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}los\\text{-}domain}\\vdash\n\\mathcal D_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal M,I}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\varphi,\\bar f\\rangle\\in V:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\bar f,\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)^I)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}los\\text{-}domain}\\vdash\n\\mathcal D_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal M,I}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\varphi,\\bar f\\rangle\\in V:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\bar f,\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)^I)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}los\\text{-}map} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel10LosMap}_S(L,U,I,\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\land\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(L,\\mathcal D_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal M,I},\\mathcal P(I))\\land\n\\forall\\langle\\varphi,\\bar f\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal M,I}\\;\nL(\\langle\\varphi,\\bar f\\rangle)=\n\\{i\\in I:\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s_{\\bar f,i})\\land\n\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s_{\\bar f,i})\\}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}los\\text{-}map} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel10LosMap}_S(L,U,I,\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\land\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(L,\\mathcal D_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal M,I},\\mathcal P(I))\\land\n\\forall\\langle\\varphi,\\bar f\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal M,I}\\;\nL(\\langle\\varphi,\\bar f\\rangle)=\n\\{i\\in I:\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s_{\\bar f,i})\\land\n\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s_{\\bar f,i})\\}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Łoś map is a set-coded function to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(I)\">\\(\\mathcal P(I)\\)</span> with an explicit domain of formulas and matching tuples of representatives.</li>\n<li>Representatives are indexed by the actual variable set, so no undefined formula-arity operator is needed; each coordinate is converted into the assignment required by the selected satisfaction recursion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"./58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,U,I,\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\mathcal D_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal M,I}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"s_{\\bar f,i}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,\\bar f(x)(i)\\rangle:x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\}","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10LosMap}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}los\\text{-}domain}\\vdash\n\\mathcal D_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal M,I}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\varphi,\\bar f\\rangle\\in V:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\bar f,\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)^I)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}los\\text{-}map} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel10LosMap}_S(L,U,I,\\mathcal M,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\land\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(L,\\mathcal D_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal M,I},\\mathcal P(I))\\land\n\\forall\\langle\\varphi,\\bar f\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_{\\Sigma,\\mathcal M,I}\\;\nL(\\langle\\varphi,\\bar f\\rangle)=\n\\{i\\in I:\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s_{\\bar f,i})\\land\n\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s_{\\bar f,i})\\}\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(I)","display":false}],"bytes":2144,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2726","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-model10-los-map.md|58-df-zfc-model10-los-map]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","36d7463d215be751","65418b505fc53093","8b6a90316aad78a4","64f35ba2e87964e0","2b6b1d9eb78a2714"]}